==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Riolu|45}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Riolu}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Riolu|76}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*'''Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Machop|59}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

